---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About | RePeak Consignment">
  <section class="wrap">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Hello! I'm Meagan, the founder of RePeak Consignment.</p>
    <p>A few years back, I realized none of my clothes fit anymore, and I needed an entirely new wardrobe. That's when I began selling my clothes online (and buying new-to-me pieces!) and quickly became hooked. After experiencing success, friends started bringing me their clothes to sell, as well. I developed an inventory system and enjoyed the process so much that I decided to turn it into a business.</p>
    <p>Since RePeak Consignment operates online instead of from a physical store, we can reach a much broader audience. We sell on popular platforms like Poshmark, Mercari and Depop, ensuring maximum exposure for our items to potential buyers.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap">
    <h2>Our purpose</h2>
    <p>At RePeak Consignment, our mission is to make sustainable fashion affordable and accessible. We are dedicated to giving pre-loved items a second life and celebrating their unique stories. Our wide range of styles and sizes promotes conscious consumption and the beauty of sustainable fashion.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/consign-with-us/">Consign with us</a>
  </section>
</Base>
